<div class="wimscenter">\(^{\ext[1]'}\) \sequence \(^{\ext[2]'}\)</div>
<div class="wimscenter">\(^{\extrep[1]'}\) \embed{r1, 20} \(^{\extrep[2]'}\)</div>
}
